## Skills to use

When work affects planning, PR evidence, demos, or publication docs, invoke the `tusker` skill.

## Workflow expectations

- The task note is the unit of work. Intent, acceptance, deliverables, verification, evidence, and work log are sections inside it.
- Keep the contract sections stable. Use execution sections for live planning, evidence, verification notes, and work log updates.
- Create a user doc or developer doc when the work changes external behavior or operator-facing surfaces.
- Reindex and validate the vault after material updates.
